.netlify
.DS_Store
*.log
node_modules
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Large source art. Several Anims/*.fbx exceed GitHub's 100MB per-file hard
# limit, so committing them would fail the push outright — and large blobs are
# effectively permanent once in history. Use Git LFS or external storage if
# these ever need to be versioned.
assets/Anims/
assets/ual-standard/
assets/*.zip
# 体素角色的原始导出（4096² 贴图，单个 13~15MB）。游戏加载的是
# scripts/bake-roles.js 烘焙出的 assets/characters/*.glb，这里只是烘焙输入。
assets/Roles/

# Local tooling / scratch output
.workbuddy/
_bones.json
_fbx_skel.json
_pose_dump.txt
diag-*.html
diag-*.png
diag-*.txt

# Reproducible UI browser-test screenshots
tmp/frontline-ui-check/
tmp/roles-check/

# Local game server process state and logs
tmp/game-server/
